  "releaseNotes": "## Summary\n- SubjectPermission perf rework: share compiled subplans across N permissions, eliminate remaining allocations, move function execution from boxed  to positional  (#287, #289, #291)\n- Fix: thread  through  so context-access function args evaluate correctly in both check engines (#288)\n- Feat: opt-in time-watermark tombstone reaper (#282)\n- Fix: eliminate two flaky tests in the tombstone reaper suite (#284)\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] CI green (build, tests, benchmarks)\n- [ ] After merge: tag  and create GitHub release to trigger NuGet publish",
